38448>>>                Case Break
38449>>>
38449>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38449>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38449>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
38449>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38450>>>
38450>>>        Case End
